<title>USA: Matlack Systems Inc Q4 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Matlack Systems Inc Q4 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.30   profit	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net	loss	    2,650   profit	 1,747</p>
<p> Revs			54,038		   57,121</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>	  12 Months</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.17   profit	 $0.74</p>
<p> Net	loss	    1,477   profit	 6,601</p>
<p> Revs		     224,866		  236,257</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,812		    8,907</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 fourth quarter includes special charge of $2.4 million after tax, or $0.28 per share, for a reduction in the tractor fleet and for closing certain terminals. It also includes related costs of $1.35 million, third party claims of $750,000 and reserves for insurance claims of $1.9 million.</p>
